1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,275
Para penyihir terbaik Mesir

2
00:00:01,295 --> 00:00:03,272
datang untuk mengalahkan Musa.

3
00:00:03,292 --> 00:00:04,185
Di akhir hari itu,

4
00:00:04,205 --> 00:00:05,893
mereka semua justru bersujud.

5
00:00:05,913 --> 00:00:07,316
Firaun menuduh Musa membawa

6
00:00:07,336 --> 00:00:08,631
sihir untuk mengusir mereka

7
00:00:08,651 --> 00:00:09,572
dari negeri.

8
00:00:09,592 --> 00:00:10,532
Ia menantang:

9
00:00:10,552 --> 00:00:11,879
kami akan datangkan sihir yang

10
00:00:11,899 --> 00:00:12,441
sama.

11
00:00:12,461 --> 00:00:13,872
Waktunya disepakati:

12
00:00:13,892 --> 00:00:14,616
hari raya,

13
00:00:14,636 --> 00:00:15,420
pagi hari,

14
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:16,463
di depan orang banyak.

15
00:00:16,483 --> 00:00:17,850
Para penyihir datang berbaris,

16
00:00:17,870 --> 00:00:18,732
yakin akan menang,

17
00:00:18,752 --> 00:00:19,723
bahkan sudah membicarakan

18
00:00:19,743 --> 00:00:21,271
hadiah dari Firaun.

19
00:00:21,291 --> 00:00:21,937
Mereka bertanya:

20
00:00:21,957 --> 00:00:22,649
wahai Musa,

21
00:00:22,669 --> 00:00:24,073
kamu yang melempar dulu,

22
00:00:24,093 --> 00:00:25,122
atau kami?

23
00:00:25,142 --> 00:00:26,073
Musa menjawab:

24
00:00:26,093 --> 00:00:27,254
silakan kalian dulu.

25
00:00:27,274 --> 00:00:29,126
Tali dan tongkat mereka tampak

26
00:00:29,146 --> 00:00:30,086
merayap cepat.

27
00:00:30,106 --> 00:00:31,727
Surah Thaha mencatatnya dengan

28
00:00:31,747 --> 00:00:32,547
jujur:

29
00:00:32,567 --> 00:00:33,832
Musa merasa takut dalam

30
00:00:33,852 --> 00:00:34,524
hatinya.

31
00:00:34,544 --> 00:00:35,964
Seorang nabi pun bisa merasa

32
00:00:35,984 --> 00:00:36,901
takut.

33
00:00:36,921 --> 00:00:38,015
Lalu wahyu turun:

34
00:00:38,035 --> 00:00:38,665
jangan takut,

35
00:00:38,685 --> 00:00:40,272
sungguh kamulah yang unggul.

36
00:00:40,292 --> 00:00:41,526
Lemparkan apa yang ada di

37
00:00:41,546 --> 00:00:42,577
tangan kananmu.

38
00:00:42,597 --> 00:00:43,924
Tongkat itu pun menelan semua

39
00:00:43,944 --> 00:00:44,749
yang mereka buat.

40
00:00:44,769 --> 00:00:46,204
Para penyihir paham,

41
00:00:46,224 --> 00:00:47,548
ini bukan sihir.

42
00:00:47,568 --> 00:00:49,220
Hanya beberapa saat sebelumnya

43
00:00:49,240 --> 00:00:50,686
mereka adalah lawan.

44
00:00:50,706 --> 00:00:52,543
Kini mereka langsung merunduk

45
00:00:52,563 --> 00:00:54,061
bersujud dan berkata:

46
00:00:54,081 --> 00:00:55,407
kami beriman kepada Tuhannya

47
00:00:55,427 --> 00:00:56,295
Harun dan Musa.

48
00:00:56,315 --> 00:00:57,897
Firaun murka dan mengancam

49
00:00:57,917 --> 00:00:59,043
akan menghukum mereka dengan

50
00:00:59,063 --> 00:00:59,947
kejam.

51
00:00:59,967 --> 00:01:00,961
Jawab mereka:

52
00:01:00,981 --> 00:01:02,091
putuskanlah apa yang hendak

53
00:01:02,111 --> 00:01:03,028
kau putuskan.

54
00:01:03,048 --> 00:01:04,049
Kau hanya berkuasa di

55
00:01:04,069 --> 00:01:05,198
kehidupan dunia ini.

56
00:01:05,218 --> 00:01:06,545
Orang yang paling paham sebuah

57
00:01:06,565 --> 00:01:08,046
tipuan, paling cepat mengenali

58
00:01:08,066 --> 00:01:08,758
kebenaran.

59
00:01:08,778 --> 00:01:09,486
Menurut kamu,

60
00:01:09,506 --> 00:01:10,446
apa yang membuat mereka

61
00:01:10,466 --> 00:01:11,158
seberani itu?

62
00:01:11,178 --> 00:01:12,535
Kisah dalam Al-Qur'an,

63
00:01:12,555 --> 00:01:13,915
bersama AUDIRA.

